{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Happy Door",
    "steam_appid": 3786990,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786990/extras/28dcee690ebea2fdb668429b72900e31.avif?t=1754997949\" data-has-big width=800 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786990/extras/9b41436057700b3e0f010be0d054b219.poster.avif?t=1754997949\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786990/extras/9b41436057700b3e0f010be0d054b219.webm?t=1754997949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786990/extras/9b41436057700b3e0f010be0d054b219.mp4?t=1754997949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One or two creatures might be manageable, but the horde is relentless. Each creature follows a unique playbook, with mechanics often conflicting one another. Eliminate them strategically, or be swallowed by the panic-induced chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786990/extras/3dc92e568cff754e4e8c84ed39d02e76.avif?t=1754997949\" data-has-big width=800 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786990/extras/fa4349629489f3b6b78de1dae2a97b6c.poster.avif?t=1754997949\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786990/extras/fa4349629489f3b6b78de1dae2a97b6c.webm?t=1754997949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786990/extras/fa4349629489f3b6b78de1dae2a97b6c.mp4?t=1754997949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into the darkness with a team of up to four. Work together to overcome the terror\u2026 or don't. You can also use a variety of items to scare your teammates! don't worry. A little revival ritual might just bring them back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786990/extras/00c6f1f7f82837186236c62fd91ddf1d.avif?t=1754997949\" data-has-big width=800 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786990/extras/4754605a4638d43c7055872c45b7424e.poster.avif?t=1754997949\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786990/extras/4754605a4638d43c7055872c45b7424e.webm?t=1754997949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786990/extras/4754605a4638d43c7055872c45b7424e.mp4?t=1754997949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The horrors of Happy Door don't manifest in ordinary ways. An unnatural humming, the trembling of nearby objects\u2014these are your only warnings as entities spawn. Rally your team and unleash light upon them to halt the summoning! Your staff isn't just a simple lamp\u2014it's your only defense for keeping the horror at bay.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786990/extras/28dcee690ebea2fdb668429b72900e31.avif?t=1754997949\" data-has-big width=800 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786990/extras/9b41436057700b3e0f010be0d054b219.poster.avif?t=1754997949\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786990/extras/9b41436057700b3e0f010be0d054b219.webm?t=1754997949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786990/extras/9b41436057700b3e0f010be0d054b219.mp4?t=1754997949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One or two creatures might be manageable, but the horde is relentless. Each creature follows a unique playbook, with mechanics often conflicting one another. Eliminate them strategically, or be swallowed by the panic-induced chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786990/extras/3dc92e568cff754e4e8c84ed39d02e76.avif?t=1754997949\" data-has-big width=800 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786990/extras/fa4349629489f3b6b78de1dae2a97b6c.poster.avif?t=1754997949\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786990/extras/fa4349629489f3b6b78de1dae2a97b6c.webm?t=1754997949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786990/extras/fa4349629489f3b6b78de1dae2a97b6c.mp4?t=1754997949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into the darkness with a team of up to four. Work together to overcome the terror\u2026 or don't. You can also use a variety of items to scare your teammates! don't worry. A little revival ritual might just bring them back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786990/extras/00c6f1f7f82837186236c62fd91ddf1d.avif?t=1754997949\" data-has-big width=800 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786990/extras/4754605a4638d43c7055872c45b7424e.poster.avif?t=1754997949\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786990/extras/4754605a4638d43c7055872c45b7424e.webm?t=1754997949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3786990/extras/4754605a4638d43c7055872c45b7424e.mp4?t=1754997949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The horrors of Happy Door don't manifest in ordinary ways. An unnatural humming, the trembling of nearby objects\u2014these are your only warnings as entities spawn. Rally your team and unleash light upon them to halt the summoning! Your staff isn't just a simple lamp\u2014it's your only defense for keeping the horror at bay.</p>",
    "short_description": "An online cooperative horror game featuring magicians, playable by up to 4 players. Use light to fend off creatures before they spawn, and safely retrieve items.",
